# Cacheleme politikası — ayrıntı: docs/Cacheleme.md
# Kural: sürümlü asset (?v=N) IMMUTABLE; HTML her zaman no-store (Worker zorlar).
# Sorgu dizesi eşleşmeye girmez → bu yollar SADECE ?v=N ile çağrılmalıdır.

/app.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/admin.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/api.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/ui.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/theme.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/kurallar.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/styles.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable